 Integer division:
 n           =           3
 n / 2       =           1
 n*(n + 1)/2 =           6
 n/2*(n + 1) =           4

 Negative integer division:
 n           =          -3
 n / 2       =          -1

 Floating point conversion:
 real(n) / 2           =   1.5000000000000000     
 n * 1.0_dp / 2        =   1.5000000000000000     
 real(n) / 2 (neg)     =  -1.5000000000000000     
 n * 1.0_dp / 2 (neg)  =  -1.5000000000000000     
